					<![CDATA[
						 <p>A question. once it has "reproduced", will the new swatch gain a distinct personality, or simply be a different conduit for the original mind?</p> <p>If it is in fact a single entity that can be spread to a variety of surfaces, could the foundation use it as a form of radio? Imagine a splash of this color on the mouthpiece of a helmet that allows anything the wearer says to be repeated by any other patch of the color.</p> <p>I'm not sure if I explained that well… it's 4:00 in the morning, so I'm not at my most coherent.</p> 
				 	]]>
